      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just an FYI- this plugin looks phenomenal in darker maps. I'll probably play around with the plugin on some better environments that I make, and update it when I get them done. but obviously worlds look phenomenally better with Aura 2.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
