  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-05-17T05:59:13.673Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Aura 2 is this amazing Unity plugin that adds lighting effects that are super optimized, and basically acts like another layer of post processing, but applicable in specific areas. Is there any way we could get support for this? I remember I set it up on one of my worlds once and it failed to function properly. Here's a preview of what I'm talking about. Think about what VRChat would look like with this stellar lighting.",
